<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He has cheeks like a bed of spices,</l><l>And His lips like pure lilies,</l><l>His legs are pillars of marble,</l><l>He’s the most desirable.</l><l>His appearance like Lebanon,</l><l>As the cedars excellent.</l><l>His mouth is sweetness itself,</l><l>That’s my Beloved and friend.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
